    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 75"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "God Humbles the Proud, but Exalts the Righteous."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the music director; set to Al-tashheth. A Psalm of Asaph, a Song."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We give thanks to You, God, we give thanks,",
          "For Your name is near;",
          "People declare Your wondrous works."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“When I select an appointed time,",
          "It is I who judge fairly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“The earth and all who inhabit it are unsteady;",
          "It is I who have firmly set its pillars."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I said to the boastful, ‘Do not boast,’",
          "And to the wicked, ‘Do not lift up the horn;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not lift up your horn on high,",
          "Do not speak with insolent pride.’ ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶For not from the east, nor from the west,",
          "Nor from the desert comes exaltation;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But God is the Judge;",
          "He puts down one and exalts another."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For a cup is in the hand of the Lord, and the wine foams;",
          "It is well mixed, and He pours out of this;",
          "Certainly all the wicked of the earth must drain and drink its dregs."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶But as for me, I will declare it forever;",
          "I will sing praises to the God of Jacob."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And He will cut off all the horns of the wicked,",
          "But the horns of the righteous will be lifted up."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
